-- examples/checks/vscode-side-effects-check.rofl — vscode_side_effects: the question of examples/vscode/side-effects.rofl
-- over examples/vscode/mini (facts in vscode-mini-facts.rofl), every answer named. Red if one is missing or one more
-- appears. The nodes: mini/node/pfs.ts n d100d8f9c1968a85, server.ts n34efd0fd49e79fa1, main.ts n6ce3b3e159e9764b.
--   a wrapper module       pfs.ts writeAtomic and remove hand their parameter to fs (_to76001thh6, _bhm3cv4bvn4), so main.ts's calls
--                          of them (_gk5hs3rc903, _nuu0h9bo98, _vdu008tnjk6) are sites with the values of their own arguments
--   a cross-file value     DEFAULT_PORT and HELLO_CHANNEL come from mini/common/channels.ts
--   a literal              spawn's `editor`, execFile's 'git', fetch's url
--   an env read            process.env.VSCODE_PORT (_3ji3d81e6n) reaches server.listen (_r7jcjg1pls5) through listenOn (_j8599nf69r7)
--   no value               remove(this.storage.dir) (_vdu008tnjk6): the storage is injected, nothing in the code builds it
--   a string built from parts (rules/js-concat.rofl), mini/node/paths.ts ndbdc6130c943fdee:
--     path.join(appRoot, 'out', name) (_dlqog2mm806)   the join's text, every part literal, beside its node
--     `${appRoot}/logs/${kind}.log` (_717kubascm2)      one text per caller's kind
--     join(dirname(__dirname), 'cache') (_lckrchp74h7)  a form: __dirname has no value and stays a reference
--     dirname('/opt/app/tmp/old') (_2babfsu3532)        cut from the literal, a real string
--     target += '/' + segment in a loop (_18bs8n5b6m) the initial literal, the += node and five forms, the loop unfolded three
--                                              levels and the rest the node itself
--     new URL('/api/update', updateBase) (_o13jg7f3n72) the URL's text, base then relative
vse_want(nd100d8f9c1968a85_to76001thh6, fs_mutation, "/tmp/settings.json").
vse_want(nd100d8f9c1968a85_bhm3cv4bvn4, fs_mutation, "/tmp/cache").
